1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videomiz nima haqida? — Yaponiyada sayohat qilish uchun yaponcha suhbatlar.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sahna 1: Chipta qanday sotib olish kerak / Poezd chiptasini sotib olish

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,604
Kechirasiz.

4
00:00:13,627 --> 00:00:16,478
Ha, nima uchun murojaat qilyapsiz?

5
00:00:16,501 --> 00:00:19,788
Tokio stansiyasiga borishni xohlayman.

6
00:00:19,812 --> 00:00:22,179
Tokio stansiyasi, shundaymi?

7
00:00:22,202 --> 00:00:26,402
Ha, chipta qayerdan sotib olish mumkin?

8
00:00:26,425 --> 00:00:29,859
Ana u yerda chiptalar avtomati orqali sotib olasiz.

9
00:00:29,882 --> 00:00:32,782
Ana u koʻk rangli mashina, shundaymi?

10
00:00:32,805 --> 00:00:35,742
Ha, aynan shu.

11
00:00:35,766 --> 00:00:39,299
Chipta avtomatidan qanday foydalanishni bilmayman.

12
00:00:39,322 --> 00:00:41,892
Birga boramiz.

13
00:00:41,915 --> 00:00:43,984
Katta rahmat.

14
00:00:44,008 --> 00:00:46,142
Juda yordam berdingiz.

15
00:00:46,165 --> 00:00:49,184
Ekrandagi ingliz tilini bosing.

16
00:00:49,207 --> 00:00:52,375
Ha, bosdim.

17
00:00:52,398 --> 00:00:55,765
Keyin Tokio stansiyasini tanlang.

18
00:00:55,788 --> 00:00:58,232
Tokio stansiyasi, shundaymi?

19
00:00:58,255 --> 00:01:00,227
Topdim.

20
00:01:00,251 --> 00:01:02,268
Kattalar uchunmi?

21
00:01:02,292 --> 00:01:03,925
Bolalar uchunmi?

22
00:01:03,948 --> 00:01:06,881
Kattalar ikki kishi.

23
00:01:06,904 --> 00:01:10,271
Unda, ikki kishini tanlang.

24
00:01:10,294 --> 00:01:12,460
Bu, shundaymi?

25
00:01:12,483 --> 00:01:14,617
Qancha turadi?

26
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:17,488
1500 yen.

27
00:01:17,511 --> 00:01:20,590
Pulni qayerga solish kerak?

28
00:01:20,614 --> 00:01:23,747
Pulni shu yerga soling.

29
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:27,005
Kredit karta ishlatish mumkinmi?

30
00:01:27,029 --> 00:01:30,285
Ha, ishlatishingiz mumkin.

31
00:01:30,308 --> 00:01:32,482
Kartani kiriting.

32
00:01:32,506 --> 00:01:35,539
Maxfiy raqamni kiriting.

33
00:01:35,562 --> 00:01:38,229
Ha, bajarildi.

34
00:01:38,252 --> 00:01:40,618
Chipta chiqib keladi.

35
00:01:40,641 --> 00:01:43,975
Ikki dona chipta oldim.

36
00:01:43,998 --> 00:01:46,731
Unutmang!

37
00:01:46,754 --> 00:01:50,354
Poyezd qaysi perondan chiqadi?

38
00:01:50,377 --> 00:01:53,274
3-perondan chiqadi.

39
00:01:53,297 --> 00:01:55,710
3-peron, shundaymi?

40
00:01:55,734 --> 00:01:57,872
Ana u yerda, shundaymi?

41
00:01:57,896 --> 00:02:02,062
Yoʻq, zinapoyadan pastga tushib, chap tomonda.

42
00:02:02,085 --> 00:02:05,860
Zinapoyadan pastga tushib, chap tomonda, shundaymi?

43
00:02:05,884 --> 00:02:09,264
Poyezd 10 daqiqadan keyin keladi.

44
00:02:09,287 --> 00:02:11,654
Tezkor poyezdmi?

45
00:02:11,676 --> 00:02:14,947
Ha, tezkor poyezd.

46
00:02:14,971 --> 00:02:17,771
Boshqa poyezdga oʻtish kerak boʻladi mi?

47
00:02:17,794 --> 00:02:21,728
Yoʻq, oʻtish kerak emas.

48
00:02:21,751 --> 00:02:23,917
Toʻgʻri borasiz.

49
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:26,274
Yaxshi boʻldi.

50
00:02:26,297 --> 00:02:29,464
Juda mehribonligingiz uchun katta rahmat.

51
00:02:29,487 --> 00:02:34,220
Arzimaydi. Yoʻlida xushchaqchingiz!

52
00:02:34,243 --> 00:02:43,252
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsiflar va eng yaxshi izohlar orqali yuklab olishingiz mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang.

53
00:02:43,252 --> 00:02:44,752
2-Sahna: Mehmonxonaga ro‘yxatdan o‘tish / Mehmonxona ro‘yxatdan o‘tish jarayoni

54
00:02:44,752 --> 00:02:46,919
Xush kelibsiz!

55
00:02:46,942 --> 00:02:48,709
Salom!

56
00:02:48,732 --> 00:02:50,498
Salom!

57
00:02:50,521 --> 00:02:53,900
Ro‘yxatdan o‘tmoqchiman.

58
00:02:53,924 --> 00:02:58,393
Ismingizni aytib berishingiz mumkinmi?

59
00:02:58,417 --> 00:03:00,783
Smit.

60
00:03:00,806 --> 00:03:03,473
Smit deb aytdingiz, shundaymi?

61
00:03:03,496 --> 00:03:07,029
Broningizni tekshirib chiqayapman.

62
00:03:07,052 --> 00:03:11,068
Ha, iltimos.

63
00:03:11,091 --> 00:03:15,025
Bugundan boshlab ikki kecha turasizmi?

64
00:03:15,048 --> 00:03:18,507
Ha, ikki kecha.

65
00:03:18,530 --> 00:03:23,264
Xonangiz chekish taqiqlangan ikki kishilik xona.

66
00:03:23,287 --> 00:03:26,384
Ha, to‘g‘ri.

67
00:03:26,408 --> 00:03:30,585
Bu yerga manzilingiz va ismingizni yozing.

68
00:03:30,608 --> 00:03:33,808
Ruchka olib ishlatsam bo‘ladimi?

69
00:03:33,831 --> 00:03:37,508
Marhamat, bu ruchkani ishlating.

70
00:03:37,532 --> 00:03:39,699
Yozib bo‘ldim.

71
00:03:39,722 --> 00:03:42,620
Pasport kerakmi?

72
00:03:42,643 --> 00:03:46,477
Ha, pasportingizni ko‘rsating.

73
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:49,633
Ha, marhamat.

74
00:03:49,656 --> 00:03:51,623
Katta rahmat.

75
00:03:51,646 --> 00:03:54,379
Nusxa olaman.

76
00:03:54,402 --> 00:03:57,899
Ha, tushunarli.

77
00:03:57,923 --> 00:03:59,730
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

78
00:03:59,754 --> 00:04:02,021
Bu sizning xona kalitingiz.

79
00:04:02,044 --> 00:04:04,777
Xona nechanchi qavatda?

80
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:08,833
Beshinchi qavat, 502-xona.

81
00:04:08,856 --> 00:04:11,754
Lift qayerda?

82
00:04:11,778 --> 00:04:15,179
U yerda, o‘ng tomonda.

83
00:04:15,202 --> 00:04:16,936
Katta rahmat.

84
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:19,759
Nonushta soat nechadan boshlanadi?

85
00:04:19,782 --> 00:04:24,715
Nonushta ertalab soat 7 dan 10 gacha.

86
00:04:24,738 --> 00:04:27,989
Nonushta qayerda?

87
00:04:28,012 --> 00:04:31,990
Birinchi qavatdagi restoranda.

88
00:04:32,014 --> 00:04:34,814
Wi-Fi paroli nima?

89
00:04:34,837 --> 00:04:38,495
Parol kartaning orqa tomonida yozilgan.

90
00:04:38,518 --> 00:04:41,484
A, rostdan ham!

91
00:04:41,507 --> 00:04:43,923
Yozib qo‘yilgan ekan.

92
00:04:43,947 --> 00:04:47,581
Katta hammomdan ham foydalanishingiz mumkin.

93
00:04:47,604 --> 00:04:50,937
Katta hammom nechanchi qavatda?

94
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:53,360
Ikkinchi qavatda.

95
00:04:53,383 --> 00:04:56,116
Soch soat nechadan boshlab kirish mumkin?

96
00:04:56,139 --> 00:05:00,388
Tushdan keyin soat 3 dan kechasi 12 gacha.

97
00:05:00,412 --> 00:05:03,751
Sochiqni xonadan olib ketish kerakmi?

98
00:05:03,774 --> 00:05:08,174
Ha, xonangizdagi sochiqni olib boring.

99
00:05:08,197 --> 00:05:10,264
Tushunarli.

100
00:05:10,287 --> 00:05:14,054
Yukimni xonaga yetkazib berish mumkinmi?

101
00:05:14,077 --> 00:05:18,143
Ha, xodimlarimiz tez orada olib borishadi.

102
00:05:18,166 --> 00:05:19,742
Katta rahmat.

103
00:05:19,766 --> 00:05:21,533
Iltimos.

104
00:05:21,555 --> 00:05:25,889
Yaxshi dam oling!

105
00:05:25,912 --> 00:05:33,017
Bugungi videoni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasi tavsiflar va eng yaxshi izohlarda mavjud. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o‘chirilishi mumkin.

106
00:05:33,017 --> 00:05:34,517
3-Sahna: Restoran bron qilish va stolni koʻrsatish / Restoran bronlash va joylash

107
00:05:34,517 --> 00:05:36,410
Xush kelibsiz!

108
00:05:36,433 --> 00:05:38,730
Necha kishilik?

109
00:05:38,754 --> 00:05:42,120
Ikki kishilik.

110
00:05:42,143 --> 00:05:46,943
Chekmaydigan joy va chekuvchi joydan qaysi birini xohlaysiz?

111
00:05:46,966 --> 00:05:50,416
Chekmaydigan joydan iltimos.

112
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:52,844
Bu tomonga keling.

113
00:05:52,868 --> 00:05:56,302
Ixtiyoriy joyga oʻtiring.

114
00:05:56,325 --> 00:05:59,491
Derazaga yaqin joy ham bo‘ladi mi?

115
00:05:59,514 --> 00:06:02,281
Ha, marhamat.

116
00:06:02,304 --> 00:06:03,987
Rahmat.

117
00:06:04,011 --> 00:06:06,690
Suv berishingiz mumkinmi?

118
00:06:06,714 --> 00:06:11,047
Ha, sovuq suv olib kelaman.

119
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:13,637
Menyuni ham ko‘rsatsangiz.

120
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:16,793
Mana, menyu.

121
00:06:16,816 --> 00:06:20,216
Inglizcha menyu ham bor.

122
00:06:20,239 --> 00:06:23,328
Inglizcha menyuni iltimos qilaman.

123
00:06:23,351 --> 00:06:26,821
Ha, biroz kutib turing.

124
00:06:26,845 --> 00:06:30,678
Bu restoranning eng mashhur taomi qaysi?

125
00:06:30,701 --> 00:06:34,435
Eng mashhuri – tonkatsu teppasi.

126
00:06:34,458 --> 00:06:37,024
Juda mazali ko‘rinibdi.

127
00:06:37,047 --> 00:06:39,414
Qanday ta'm?

128
00:06:39,437 --> 00:06:44,404
Go‘shti yumshoq, sousi shirin.

129
00:06:44,427 --> 00:06:48,476
Unda, tonkatsu teppasini bir porsiya bering.

130
00:06:48,499 --> 00:06:52,539
Ha, tonkatsu teppasi bir porsiya.

131
00:06:52,563 --> 00:06:56,329
Do‘stlarimdan biri cho‘chqa go‘shti yeyolmaydi.

132
00:06:56,352 --> 00:06:59,786
Baliq taomlari ham bor.

133
00:06:59,809 --> 00:07:03,895
Sashimi teppasi bormi?

134
00:07:03,918 --> 00:07:09,285
Ha, bugungi tavsiya etilgan sashimi teppasi bor.

135
00:07:09,308 --> 00:07:13,376
Unda, sashimi teppasini ham bir porsiya bering.

136
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:16,199
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

137
00:07:16,222 --> 00:07:19,989
Guruch hajmini tanlash mumkinmi?

138
00:07:20,012 --> 00:07:24,978
Katta, oddiy va kichik hajmlarni tanlash mumkin.

139
00:07:25,001 --> 00:07:28,234
Ikkalasi ham oddiy hajmda bering.

140
00:07:28,257 --> 00:07:32,343
Ichimlik nima olasiz?

141
00:07:32,367 --> 00:07:35,863
Ikki pivo bering.

142
00:07:35,887 --> 00:07:39,583
Ichimliklarni darhol olib kelaylikmi?

143
00:07:39,607 --> 00:07:43,007
Ha, avval ichimliklarni bering.

144
00:07:43,030 --> 00:07:45,263
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

145
00:07:45,286 --> 00:07:47,853
Tasdiqlaymiz.

146
00:07:47,876 --> 00:07:50,009
Ha, iltimos.

147
00:07:50,032 --> 00:07:58,638
Tonkatsu teppasi bir porsiya, sashimi teppasi bir porsiya va ikki pivo, shundaymi?

148
00:07:58,661 --> 00:08:01,428
Vasabi muammo bo‘lmaydimi?

149
00:08:01,451 --> 00:08:05,184
Sashimidan vasabini olib tashlang.

150
00:08:05,207 --> 00:08:07,441
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

151
00:08:07,464 --> 00:08:08,964
4-Sahna: Xizmat ko‘rsatish asoslari / Mijozlarga xizmat ko‘rsatish asoslari

152
00:08:08,964 --> 00:08:10,939
Xush kelibsiz!

153
00:08:10,962 --> 00:08:13,440
Nimadir izlayapsizmi?

154
00:08:13,464 --> 00:08:17,064
Bu futbolkani ko‘rib chiqsam bo‘ladimi?

155
00:08:17,087 --> 00:08:18,545
Ha.

156
00:08:18,568 --> 00:08:22,101
Ixtiyoriy qilib ko‘ring.

157
00:08:22,124 --> 00:08:25,411
Bu futbolkaning M o‘lchami bormi?

158
00:08:25,435 --> 00:08:28,603
Tasdiqlab kelaman.

159
00:08:28,626 --> 00:08:30,901
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

160
00:08:30,925 --> 00:08:32,458
Ha.

161
00:08:32,481 --> 00:08:34,514
Iltimos.

162
00:08:34,537 --> 00:08:36,704
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

163
00:08:36,727 --> 00:08:39,329
Bu M oʻlchamidagi mahsulot.

164
00:08:39,353 --> 00:08:41,047
Katta rahmat.

165
00:08:41,070 --> 00:08:43,527
Sinab koʻrishim mumkinmi?

166
00:08:43,551 --> 00:08:45,204
Ha.

167
00:08:45,228 --> 00:08:48,161
Albatta, sinab koʻrishingiz mumkin.

168
00:08:48,184 --> 00:08:50,464
Sinab koʻrish xonasi qayerda?

169
00:08:50,487 --> 00:08:53,421
U yerda, ichkarida joylashgan.

170
00:08:53,444 --> 00:08:55,810
Kiyib koʻrayapman.

171
00:08:55,833 --> 00:08:57,700
Qanday boʻldi?

172
00:08:57,723 --> 00:09:00,060
Aynan mos keldi.

173
00:09:00,083 --> 00:09:02,483
Shuni olaman.

174
00:09:02,506 --> 00:09:04,440
Katta rahmat.

175
00:09:04,463 --> 00:09:07,269
Boshqa ranglari ham qiziqasizmi?

176
00:09:07,292 --> 00:09:10,259
Qora rangi bormi?

177
00:09:10,282 --> 00:09:11,915
Ha.

178
00:09:11,938 --> 00:09:15,017
Qora, oq va koʻk ranglari bor.

179
00:09:15,041 --> 00:09:18,508
Qora rangdagi M oʻlchamini ham koʻrsatib bering.

180
00:09:18,530 --> 00:09:20,387
Ha.

181
00:09:20,411 --> 00:09:23,450
Bu qora rangdagi M oʻlcham.

182
00:09:23,474 --> 00:09:26,089
Bu ham juda zoʻr koʻrinadi.

183
00:09:26,112 --> 00:09:28,408
Ikki donasini olaman.

184
00:09:28,432 --> 00:09:30,074
Katta rahmat.

185
00:09:30,097 --> 00:09:33,513
Sovgʻa uchun shirinliklar ham qiziqasizmi?

186
00:09:33,537 --> 00:09:36,770
Mashhur shirinliklar bormi?

187
00:09:36,793 --> 00:09:40,651
Bu matcha pechenyelari juda mashhur.

188
00:09:40,675 --> 00:09:43,275
Shundan uchta quti bering.

189
00:09:43,298 --> 00:09:45,708
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

190
00:09:45,731 --> 00:09:48,064
Kassaga oʻtishingiz mumkin.

191
00:09:48,087 --> 00:09:50,487
Soliqdan ozod qilinadimi?

192
00:09:50,510 --> 00:09:55,544
5000 yendan ortiq boʻlgani uchun soliqdan ozod qilinadi.

193
00:09:55,567 --> 00:09:57,733
Pasportim bor.

194
00:09:57,756 --> 00:10:00,971
Pasportingizni koʻrsatib yuborishingiz mumkinmi?

195
00:10:00,995 --> 00:10:02,246
Ha.

196
00:10:02,270 --> 00:10:04,080
Marhamat.

197
00:10:04,103 --> 00:10:07,037
Jami 6000 yen boʻladi.

198
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:10,074
Kredit karta bilan toʻlash mumkinmi?

199
00:10:10,097 --> 00:10:11,792
Ha.

200
00:10:11,815 --> 00:10:14,483
Tachlash orqali ham toʻlash mumkin.

201
00:10:14,507 --> 00:10:16,674
Karta bilan toʻlayman.

202
00:10:16,697 --> 00:10:19,430
Bu yerga tachlang.

203
00:10:19,453 --> 00:10:21,086
Ha.

204
00:10:21,109 --> 00:10:22,843
Tachladim.

205
00:10:22,866 --> 00:10:24,485
Katta rahmat.

206
00:10:24,508 --> 00:10:27,241
Chek va pasportingiz.

207
00:10:27,265 --> 00:10:30,635
Sumkaga solib berishingiz mumkinmi?

208
00:10:30,659 --> 00:10:31,793
Ha.

209
00:10:31,817 --> 00:10:35,219
Katta sumkaga solib beraman.

210
00:10:35,242 --> 00:10:36,909
Katta rahmat.

211
00:10:36,932 --> 00:10:38,780
Katta yordam berdingiz.

212
00:10:38,803 --> 00:10:41,737
Yaxshi sayohat tilayman!

213
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,260
5-Sahna: Xarid qilish suhbati / Xarid qilish asoslari

214
00:10:43,260 --> 00:10:45,426
Xush kelibsiz!

215
00:10:45,449 --> 00:10:46,909
Kechirasiz.

216
00:10:46,932 --> 00:10:49,899
Issiq choy qayerda?

217
00:10:49,922 --> 00:10:54,255
Kirish qismida issiq ichimliklar boʻlimi bor.

218
00:10:54,278 --> 00:10:55,912
Katta rahmat.

219
00:10:55,935 --> 00:10:57,940
Qarab koʻray.

220
00:10:57,964 --> 00:11:01,039
Nimadir izlayapsizmi?

221
00:11:01,062 --> 00:11:03,679
Soyabon sotiladimi?

222
00:11:03,702 --> 00:11:07,375
Ha, u yerda javonning yonida bor.

223
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:12,068
Bitta plastik soyabon va bitta choy olaman.

224
00:11:12,091 --> 00:11:14,625
Bento ham olasizmi?

225
00:11:14,648 --> 00:11:16,663
Juda mazali.

226
00:11:16,686 --> 00:11:19,965
Bu qovurilgan tovuqli bentoni ham bering.

227
00:11:19,989 --> 00:11:22,522
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

228
00:11:22,545 --> 00:11:24,823
Kassada qabul qilamiz.

229
00:11:24,847 --> 00:11:27,126
Kassa shu yerdami?

230
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:29,883
Ha, iltimos, bu tomonga keling.

231
00:11:29,906 --> 00:11:33,073
Bento-ni isitib berish mumkinmi?

232
00:11:33,096 --> 00:11:35,829
Ha, isitaman.

233
00:11:35,852 --> 00:11:38,219
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

234
00:11:38,242 --> 00:11:40,619
Qancha vaqt ketadi?

235
00:11:40,642 --> 00:11:43,442
Bir daqiqa atrofida isiydi.

236
00:11:43,465 --> 00:11:46,444
Xashak yoki qoshiq berish mumkinmi?

237
00:11:46,467 --> 00:11:49,634
Xashakdan nechtasini qo‘shay?

238
00:11:49,657 --> 00:11:51,890
Bitta yetadi.

239
00:11:51,913 --> 00:11:54,522
Qoshiq ham qo‘shaymi?

240
00:11:54,546 --> 00:11:56,844
Qoshiq kerak emas.

241
00:11:56,867 --> 00:11:59,758
Truba ham kerakmi?

242
00:11:59,782 --> 00:12:03,248
Choy ekan, truba ham kerak emas.

