Buni eshitib, yuragim tinchlandi.

481
00:23:03,751 --> 00:23:07,918
Bugun turadigan mehmonxonagacha yo'lni bilasizmi?

482
00:23:07,941 --> 00:23:11,474
Aslida, yo'lda adashib qoldim.

483
00:23:11,497 --> 00:23:16,530
Xaritani chop etib beraman.

484
00:23:16,553 --> 00:23:18,593
Mening uchun shunchalik mehribon bo'lganingiz uchun juda minnatdorman.

485
00:23:18,617 --> 00:23:22,150
Mehmonxonagacha borishda ehtiyot bo'ling.

486
00:23:22,173 --> 00:23:23,673
10-Sahna: Mehmonxonadan chiqish / Mehmonxona chek-aut tartibi

487
00:23:23,673 --> 00:23:26,155
Xayrli tong!

488
00:23:26,179 --> 00:23:28,114
Chek-aut qilmoqchimisiz?

489
00:23:28,137 --> 00:23:32,804
Ha, chek-aut qilishni iltimos qilaman.

490
00:23:32,828 --> 00:23:36,228
Xonangiz kalitini bizga topshirasiz.

491
00:23:36,251 --> 00:23:40,691
Xona raqami 305-xona.

492
00:23:40,714 --> 00:23:42,354
Marhamat.

493
00:23:42,377 --> 00:23:44,377
Katta rahmat.

494
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:48,434
Xonada ichimliklardan foydalandizmi?

495
00:23:48,457 --> 00:23:51,823
Muzlatgichdagi suvdan foydalandim.

496
00:23:51,846 --> 00:23:55,455
Suv bir shisha 200 yen turadi.

497
00:23:55,478 --> 00:23:58,012
Naqd pul bilan to‘layman.

498
00:23:58,035 --> 00:23:59,635
Marhamat.

499
00:23:59,658 --> 00:24:03,141
Aynan 200 yenni olamiz.

500
00:24:03,164 --> 00:24:05,731
Mehmonxonada qolishingiz qanday bo'ldi?

501
00:24:05,754 --> 00:24:08,887
Juda qulay o'tdi.

502
00:24:08,910 --> 00:24:11,802
Buni eshitganimizdan xursandmiz.

503
00:24:11,825 --> 00:24:16,203
Xona juda toza edi, nonushta ham juda mazali edi.

504
00:24:16,227 --> 00:24:17,829
Katta rahmat.

505
00:24:17,852 --> 00:24:20,985
Pazandachilarga yetkazamiz.

506
00:24:21,008 --> 00:24:24,419
Chiqish uchun barcha tartiblar yakunlandi.

507
00:24:24,442 --> 00:24:29,309
Yuklarimni kechgacha saqlab qo'yishingiz mumkinmi?

508
00:24:29,332 --> 00:24:33,026
Albatta, mamnuniyat bilan saqlab qo'yamiz.

509
00:24:33,049 --> 00:24:37,216
Chemodanlarim ikkita bor.

510
00:24:37,239 --> 00:24:40,474
Mana bu yorliqni ulashingiz mumkin.

511
00:24:40,497 --> 00:24:42,330
Bu almashtirish kuponimi?

512
00:24:42,353 --> 00:24:43,925
Ha.

513
00:24:43,949 --> 00:24:47,482
Bu raqamli yorliqni yo'qotmang.

514
00:24:47,505 --> 00:24:49,356
Tushunarli.

515
00:24:49,380 --> 00:24:52,231
Necha vaqtgacha saqlab qo'yishingiz mumkin?

516
00:24:52,254 --> 00:24:55,949
Bugun kechgacha, soat 20:00 gacha kelishingiz mumkin.

517
00:24:55,973 --> 00:25:00,906
Shinkansen soat 19:00 da, shuning uchun soat 18:00 da qaytaman.

518
00:25:00,929 --> 00:25:03,015
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

519
00:25:03,039 --> 00:25:05,439
Sizni kutamiz.

520
00:25:05,462 --> 00:25:09,866
Yaqin atrofda mazali grechka lag'moni bormi?

521
00:25:09,889 --> 00:25:14,489
Mehmonxona orqasida mashhur grechka lag'moni bor.

522
00:25:14,512 --> 00:25:16,350
Piyoda borish mumkinmi?

523
00:25:16,373 --> 00:25:17,973
Ha.

524
00:25:17,996 --> 00:25:20,396
Piyoda uch daqiqa masofada.

525
00:25:20,419 --> 00:25:22,819
U yerga borib ko'raman.

526
00:25:22,842 --> 00:25:26,376
Do'konga boradigan xaritani beraymi?

527
00:25:26,399 --> 00:25:27,850
Iltimos.

528
00:25:27,874 --> 00:25:31,649
Bu xaritadagi qizil belgilangan joy.

529
00:25:31,672 --> 00:25:33,872
Juda tushunarli.

530
00:25:33,895 --> 00:25:35,495
Katta rahmat.

531
00:25:35,518 --> 00:25:39,285
Bugun ham yaxshi dam oling.

532
00:25:39,308 --> 00:25:43,108
Xodimlaringiz juda mehribon edilar.

533
00:25:43,131 --> 00:25:47,071
Bunday deb aytganingizdan faxrlanaman.

534
00:25:47,094 --> 00:25:51,294
Yana Yaponiyaga kelganimda, shu yerda to'layman.

535
00:25:51,317 --> 00:25:54,131
Iltimos, yana keling.

536
00:25:54,155 --> 00:25:58,555
Keyinroq yukimni olish uchun qaytib kelaman.

537
00:25:58,578 --> 00:26:00,350
Xayr, yo'luniz ochiq bo'lsin!

538
00:26:00,373 --> 00:26:02,740
Sizni kutamiz.

539
00:26:02,763 --> 00:26:04,263
11-Sahna: Shinkansen chiptasini sotib olish / Shinkansen chiptasini qanday sotib olish kerak

540
00:26:04,263 --> 00:26:06,396
Xush kelibsiz!

541
00:26:06,419 --> 00:26:10,266
Shinkansen chiptasini sotib olmoqchiman.

542
00:26:10,290 --> 00:26:13,490
Qayerga ketmoqchisiz?

543
00:26:13,514 --> 00:26:16,606
Kyotoga bormoqchiman.

544
00:26:16,630 --> 00:26:18,671
Kyoto, shundaymi?

545
00:26:18,694 --> 00:26:21,563
Bugun jo'naysizmi?

546
00:26:21,586 --> 00:26:25,519
Ha, bugungi tushlik poyezdda ketmoqchiman.

547
00:26:25,542 --> 00:26:27,776
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

548
00:26:27,799 --> 00:26:32,492
Erkin joy yoki belgilangan joy, qaysi birini xohlaysiz?

549
00:26:32,515 --> 00:26:35,292
Belgilangan joyni iltimos qilaman.

550
00:26:35,316 --> 00:26:38,882
Qaysi vaqtda jo'nashni xohlaysiz?

551
00:26:38,905 --> 00:26:42,905
Soat o'n ikki atrofida poyezd bormi?

552
00:26:42,928 --> 00:26:47,339
Soat o'n ikki beshda ketadigan Hikari poyezdi bor.

553
00:26:47,363 --> 00:26:49,429
Shuni iltimos qilaman.

554
00:26:49,452 --> 00:26:52,819
O'rindiq bo'yicha istagingiz bormi?

555
00:26:52,842 --> 00:26:56,709
Fudzi tog'i ko'rinadigan tomonda joy bormi?

556
00:26:56,732 --> 00:26:58,215
Ha.

557
00:26:58,239 --> 00:27:01,681
E o'rindig'i Fudzi tog'i tomonida.

558
00:27:01,705 --> 00:27:05,387
Fudzi tog'i ko'rinadigan tomonda joy qilib qo'ying.

559
00:27:05,410 --> 00:27:07,468
Tushunarli.

560
00:27:07,492 --> 00:27:10,825
Derazaga yaqin E o'rindig'ini band qilaman.

561
00:27:10,848 --> 00:27:12,615
Katta rahmat.

562
00:27:12,638 --> 00:27:16,933
Kattalar uchun bir kishi bo'ladimi?

563
00:27:16,956 --> 00:27:19,756
Ha, bir kishi.

564
00:27:19,779 --> 00:27:21,422
Bir tomonlama mi?

565
00:27:21,446 --> 00:27:23,179
Yoki qaytish chiptasi kerakmi?

566
00:27:23,202 --> 00:27:26,085
Bir tomonlama iltimos qilaman.

567
00:27:26,109 --> 00:27:30,767
To'lov miqdori 13 800 yen bo'ladi.

568
00:27:30,791 --> 00:27:33,726
Kredit karta bilan toʻlash mumkinmi?

569
00:27:33,749 --> 00:27:37,349
Iltimos, bu mashinaga pulni soling.

570
00:27:37,372 --> 00:27:39,840
Ha, soldi.

571
00:27:39,864 --> 00:27:42,864
Maxfiy raqamingizni kiriting.

572
00:27:42,887 --> 00:27:45,053
Kiritdim.

573
00:27:45,076 --> 00:27:46,732
Katta rahmat.

574
00:27:46,756 --> 00:27:49,156
Chiptangizni oling.

575
00:27:49,179 --> 00:27:54,112
Poyezdda do'kon yoki savdo aravalari bormi?

576
00:27:54,135 --> 00:27:58,771
Ha, aravalarda tushlik va ichimliklar sotiladi.

577
00:27:58,795 --> 00:28:01,528
Tushlik ham sotib olmoqchiman.

578
00:28:01,551 --> 00:28:05,518
Platformada ham juda mazali tushliklar sotadigan do'kon bor.

579
00:28:05,541 --> 00:28:07,474
Bundaymi.

580
00:28:07,497 --> 00:28:09,988
Minishdan oldin ko'rib chiqaman.

581
00:28:10,011 --> 00:28:14,066
Shinkansen 14-platformadan jo'naydi.

582
00:28:14,090 --> 00:28:16,709
14-platforma, shundaymi?

583
00:28:16,733 --> 00:28:18,866
Tushunarli.

584
00:28:18,889 --> 00:28:22,731
Jo'nashdan besh daqiqa oldin platformada kutib turing.

585
00:28:22,754 --> 00:28:26,788
Juda yaxshi xizmat ko'rsatganingiz uchun rahmat.

586
00:28:26,811 --> 00:28:29,777
Yaxshi sayohat tilayman!

587
00:28:29,800 --> 00:28:31,300
12-Sahna: Issiq buloqqa kirish tartibi / Issiq buloqqa kirish tartibi

588
00:28:31,300 --> 00:28:33,189
Xush kelibsiz!

589
00:28:33,212 --> 00:28:35,746
Kunlik choʻmilishga keldingizmi?

590
00:28:35,769 --> 00:28:39,302
Ha, issiq buloqda choʻmilmoqchiman.

591
00:28:39,325 --> 00:28:41,258
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

592
00:28:41,281 --> 00:28:45,248
Kattalar uchun bir kishiga ming yen.

593
00:28:45,271 --> 00:28:47,804
Choʻmilish uchun toʻlovni beraman.

594
00:28:47,827 --> 00:28:50,395
Ha, ming yen.

595
00:28:50,419 --> 00:28:52,264
Katta rahmat.

596
00:28:52,288 --> 00:28:56,025
Afsuski, sochiqlar kiradimi?

597
00:28:56,049 --> 00:28:59,917
Yoʻq, sochiqlar alohida toʻlanadi.

598
00:28:59,941 --> 00:29:02,974
Sochiqni ijaraga olish mumkinmi?

599
00:29:02,997 --> 00:29:09,764
Ha, yuz sochiq ikki yuz yen, katta sochiq uch yuz yen.

600
00:29:09,787 --> 00:29:11,991
Ikkalasini ham olmoqchiman.

601
00:29:12,014 --> 00:29:14,347
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

602
00:29:14,370 --> 00:29:16,983
Toʻplamda besh yuz yen boʻladi.

603
00:29:17,007 --> 00:29:19,245
Ha, marhamat.

604
00:29:19,268 --> 00:29:21,038
Katta rahmat.

605
00:29:21,061 --> 00:29:24,028
Sizga sochiqlarni berayapman.

606
00:29:24,051 --> 00:29:27,728
Issiq buloqqa kirish qoidasi bormi?

607
00:29:27,752 --> 00:29:31,011
Bir nechta muhim odob-qoidalar bor.

608
00:29:31,034 --> 00:29:32,925
Aytib bering, iltimos.

609
00:29:32,949 --> 00:29:38,015
Avvalo, hovuzga kirishdan oldin tanangizni yuving.

610
00:29:38,038 --> 00:29:41,306
Tananı yuvib olaman.

611
00:29:41,330 --> 00:29:42,944
Ha.

612
00:29:42,968 --> 00:29:47,101
Yuvinish joyida tanangizni toza yuving.

613
00:29:47,124 --> 00:29:48,491
Tushunarli.

614
00:29:48,514 --> 00:29:52,047
Sochiqni hovuzga solish mumkinmi?

615
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:56,157
Yoʻq, sochiqni hovuzga solib boʻlmaydi.

616
00:29:56,181 --> 00:29:58,981
Sochiqni qayerga qoʻyish kerak?

617
00:29:59,004 --> 00:30:03,804
Sochiqni boshga qoʻyishingiz yoki hammom chetiga qoʻyishingiz mumkin.

618
00:30:03,827 --> 00:30:05,502
Tushunarli.

619
00:30:05,525 --> 00:30:08,558
Sochi uzun odamlar nima qilish kerak?

620
00:30:08,581 --> 00:30:13,115
Sochlaringiz hovuzga tegmasligi uchun bogʻlab qoʻying.

621
00:30:13,139 --> 00:30:14,939
Tushunarli.

622
00:30:14,962 --> 00:30:18,695
Kiyim yechish xonasida shkaf bormi?

623
00:30:18,718 --> 00:30:19,966
Ha.

624
00:30:19,989 --> 00:30:22,637
Qulfli shkaflar mavjud.

625
00:30:22,661 --> 00:30:25,309
Qimmatbaho narsalarni ham joylashtirish mumkin.

626
00:30:25,333 --> 00:30:26,820
Ha.

627
00:30:26,843 --> 00:30:30,443
Kalonkani qoʻlingizga taqib, hammomga kirishingiz mumkin.

628
00:30:30,466 --> 00:30:34,033
Hammomdan keyin ichimlik sotib olish mumkinmi?

629
00:30:34,056 --> 00:30:39,189
Dam olish joyida sut va sharbatlar uchun avtomatlar bor.

630
00:30:39,212 --> 00:30:41,179
Juda yaxshi, shu bilan.

631
00:30:41,201 --> 00:30:42,935
Borib kelaman.

632
00:30:42,958 --> 00:30:45,891
Yaxshi dam oling!

633
00:30:45,914 --> 00:30:47,414
13-Sahna: Shinkansen bronini oʻzgartirish va yuk oʻlchamlari

634
00:30:47,414 --> 00:30:51,783
Mijozim, nima uchun murojaat qilyapsiz?

635
00:30:51,806 --> 00:30:55,940
Ertangi Shinkansen bronini oʻzgartirmoqchiman.

636
00:30:55,963 --> 00:30:57,736
Oʻzgartirish, tushunarli.

637
00:30:57,759 --> 00:31:01,646
Sizning chiptangizni koʻrsatsangiz boʻladi mi?

638
00:31:01,670 --> 00:31:04,403
Ha, mana bu chipta.

639
00:31:04,426 --> 00:31:06,305
Katta rahmat.

640
00:31:06,329 --> 00:31:09,227
Qanday oʻzgartirmoqchisiz?

641
00:31:09,250 --> 00:31:12,284
Katta chamadonim bor.

642
00:31:12,307 --> 00:31:14,840
Ha, katta chamadon.

643
00:31:14,863 --> 00:31:18,138
Chamadonning oʻlchami qanday?

644
00:31:18,162 --> 00:31:23,979
Uzunligi, eni va balandligi jami 180 santimetr.

645
00:31:24,002 --> 00:31:29,572
Unda maxsus katta yuk joyi bron qilish kerak boʻladi.

646
00:31:29,596 --> 00:31:32,444
Oddiy oʻrindiqda joylashtirish mumkin emasmi?

647
00:31:32,468 --> 00:31:33,923
Ha.

648
00:31:33,946 --> 00:31:40,680
Uch oʻlchamining yigʻindisi 160 santimetrdan oshsa, bron qilish kerak.

649
00:31:40,703 --> 00:31:43,669
Yukni qoʻyish uchun joy bormi?

650
00:31:43,692 --> 00:31:48,695
Vagonning eng oxirgi oʻrindigʻi orqasida joy bor.

651
00:31:48,719 --> 00:31:53,486
Shu joy bor oʻrindiqqa oʻzgartirish mumkinmi?

652
00:31:53,509 --> 00:31:57,283
Iltimos, ertaga istalgan vaqtni ayting.

653
00:31:57,306 --> 00:32:01,284
Soat 10 atrofidagi poyezd yaxshi bo‘ladi.

654
00:32:01,307 --> 00:32:03,953
Bo‘sh joylarni tekshirib ko‘rayapman.

655
00:32:03,976 --> 00:32:06,010
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

656
00:32:06,033 --> 00:32:07,966
Iltimos.

657
00:32:07,989 --> 00:32:13,801
Soat 10:15 da jo‘nab ketadigan poyezdda katta yuk joyi bo‘sh.

658
00:32:13,824 --> 00:32:15,958
Yaxshi boʻldi.

659
00:32:15,980 --> 00:32:18,314
Shu joyni band qilib qo‘ying.

660
00:32:18,337 --> 00:32:22,546
Joyingiz oxirgi qatorning derazaga yaqin tomoni bo‘ladi.

661
00:32:22,569 --> 00:32:27,003
Yukimni o‘zimning joyimning orqasiga qo‘yishim mumkinmi?

662
00:32:27,026 --> 00:32:28,628
Ha.

663
00:32:28,651 --> 00:32:32,269
Bu faqat siz uchun ajratilgan maxsus joy.

664
00:32:32,292 --> 00:32:35,629
Qo‘shimcha to‘lov bormi?

665
00:32:35,653 --> 00:32:40,460
Oldindan band qilib qo‘ysangiz, qo‘shimcha to‘lov olmaymiz.

666
00:32:40,483 --> 00:32:43,052
Demak, bepul o‘zgartirish mumkin ekan.

667
00:32:43,076 --> 00:32:44,609
Ha.

668
00:32:44,632 --> 00:32:47,799
Bu sizning yangi chiptangiz.

669
00:32:47,822 --> 00:32:49,658
Tekshirib ko‘rayapman.

670
00:32:49,681 --> 00:32:53,814
Katta yuk joyi bor deb yozilgan ekan.

671
00:32:53,837 --> 00:32:55,251
Ha.

672
00:32:55,275 --> 00:32:57,242
Xato yo‘q.

673
00:32:57,265 --> 00:33:00,363
Mehribonligingiz uchun katta rahmat.

674
00:33:00,386 --> 00:33:03,469
Yo‘lga ehtiyot bo‘ling.

675
00:33:03,493 --> 00:33:04,993
14-SAHNA: Benzin quyish tartibi / Benzin quyish qoidalari

676
00:33:04,993 --> 00:33:08,160
Xush kelibsiz!

677
00:33:08,183 --> 00:33:11,249
Benzin quyish kerakmi?

678
00:33:11,272 --> 00:33:13,713
Ha, iltimos.

679
00:33:13,737 --> 00:33:17,357
Qaysi turini tanlaysiz?

680
00:33:17,380 --> 00:33:22,581
Ijaraga olingan mashina, qanday benzin quyish kerak?

681
00:33:22,604 --> 00:33:29,537
Mashinaning benzin quyish joyi orqasiga yoki texpasportga qarang.

682
00:33:29,560 --> 00:33:33,327
Qizil stiker bor.

683
00:33:33,350 --> 00:33:37,489
Qizil stiker oddiy benzin degani.

684
00:33:37,512 --> 00:33:40,946
Oddiy benzinni to‘liq quyib qo‘ying.

685
00:33:40,969 --> 00:33:43,202
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

686
00:33:43,225 --> 00:33:47,992
Derazalarni artib tashlashim mumkinmi?

687
00:33:48,015 --> 00:33:50,499
Ha, iltimos.

688
00:33:50,522 --> 00:33:53,889
Kul qutisi yoki axlat bormi?

689
00:33:53,912 --> 00:33:56,912
Axlat yo‘q.

690
00:33:56,935 --> 00:33:59,468
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

691
00:33:59,491 --> 00:34:03,987
Benzin quyib bo‘lishini biroz kutib turing.

692
00:34:04,010 --> 00:34:08,610
Ijara kompaniyasiga chekni ko‘rsatishingiz kerak.

693
00:34:08,633 --> 00:34:11,400
Chek kerakmi?

694
00:34:11,423 --> 00:34:16,837
To‘liq quyilganligi haqidagi guvohnoma bilan birga beramiz.

695
00:34:16,860 --> 00:34:19,193
Juda yordam berdingiz.

696
00:34:19,216 --> 00:34:21,850
Kutib turganingiz uchun uzr.

697
00:34:21,873 --> 00:34:27,073
Benzin quyish yakunlandi.

698
00:34:27,096 --> 00:34:29,387
Qancha bo‘ldi?

699
00:34:29,411 --> 00:34:34,217
Jami 4500 yen bo‘ladi.

700
00:34:34,240 --> 00:34:37,458
Kredit karta bilan toʻlash mumkinmi?

701
00:34:37,482 --> 00:34:41,015
Ha, bu karta bilan to‘lash mumkin.

702
00:34:41,038 --> 00:34:45,171
Shu karta bilan to‘layman.

703
00:34:45,194 --> 00:34:49,794
Imzo yoki PIN-kodni kiriting.

704
00:34:49,817 --> 00:34:54,220
Ha, PIN-kodni kiritdim.

705
00:34:54,244 --> 00:34:56,222
Katta rahmat.

706
00:34:56,245 --> 00:35:01,016
Bu sizning kartangiz va to‘liq quyilganligi haqidagi chek.

707
00:35:01,039 --> 00:35:06,496
To‘liq deyilgan ekan.

708
00:35:06,520 --> 00:35:10,218
Ha, ijara kompaniyasiga bering.

709
00:35:10,241 --> 00:35:14,500
Ijara mashinani qaytarish joyi shu yaqinlarda mi?

710
00:35:14,524 --> 00:35:19,260
Ha, bu chorrahadan o‘ngga burilib ketaversangiz, darhol topasiz.

711
00:35:19,283 --> 00:35:21,117
Tushunarli.

712
00:35:21,140 --> 00:35:23,740
Shu yaqin ekan.

713
00:35:23,763 --> 00:35:31,840
Mashinani qaytarishda xodimlar shikastlarni tekshiradilar.

714
00:35:31,864 --> 00:35:35,945
Yaxshi, xavfsiz haydab boraman.

715
00:35:35,968 --> 00:35:37,901
Rahmat.

716
00:35:37,924 --> 00:35:40,324
Yo‘lga ehtiyot bo‘ling.

717
00:35:40,347 --> 00:35:41,847
15-SAHNA: Kimono ijarasi tartibi / Kimono ijarasi jarayoni

718
00:35:41,847 --> 00:35:44,096
Xush kelibsiz!

719
00:35:44,120 --> 00:35:47,253
Kimono ijarasiga xush kelibsiz!

720
00:35:47,276 --> 00:35:48,810
Salom!

721
00:35:48,833 --> 00:35:51,689
Kimono ijaraga olishni istayman.

722
00:35:51,712 --> 00:35:54,571
Band qilib qoʻydingizmi?

723
00:35:54,594 --> 00:35:58,128
Ha, internet orqali band qildim.

724
00:35:58,151 --> 00:36:01,970
Ismingizni aytib bera olasizmi?

725
00:36:01,993 --> 00:36:03,827
Smit.

726
00:36:03,850 --> 00:36:06,301
Smit deb aytdingiz, shundaymi?

727
00:36:06,324 --> 00:36:10,890
Bugun kimono kiyish va soch turmagi xizmati band qilingan, shundaymi?

728
00:36:10,913 --> 00:36:13,748
Ha, aynan shu.

729
00:36:13,772 --> 00:36:18,573
Avval bu yerda yoqtirgan kimonongizni tanlang.

730
00:36:18,596 --> 00:36:22,963
Koʻp tanlov bor, qaysini tanlashimni bilmayapman.

731
00:36:22,986 --> 00:36:27,070
Pushti va qizil ranglar juda mashhur.

732
00:36:27,093 --> 00:36:30,860
Bu koʻk kimono juda chiroyli ekan.

733
00:36:30,883 --> 00:36:33,684
Bu rangni tanlayman.

734
00:36:33,707 --> 00:36:36,676
Bu rang juda ajoyib!

735
00:36:36,700 --> 00:36:39,997
Endi obini tanlaymiz.

736
00:36:40,020 --> 00:36:43,229
Qaysi obi yaxshi boʻladi?

737
00:36:43,253 --> 00:36:48,187
Sariq yoki oq obi bilan juda yoqimli koʻrinadi.

738
00:36:48,210 --> 00:36:52,305
Unda, sariq obini tanlayman.

739
00:36:52,328 --> 00:36:56,022
Oyoq kiyim uchun paypoq oʻlchovingiz qaysi?

740
00:36:56,046 --> 00:37:00,865
Oyoq oʻlchovim 24 santimetr.

741
00:37:00,889 --> 00:37:05,295
24 santimetrli paypoq tayyorlaymiz.

742
00:37:05,318 --> 00:37:09,085
Kimono kiyishga qancha vaqt ketadi?

743
00:37:09,108 --> 00:37:14,241
Kimono kiyish va soch turmak uchun 30 daqiqa kerak boʻladi.

744
00:37:14,264 --> 00:37:16,998
Kimono kiyishni iltimos qilaman.

745
00:37:17,021 --> 00:37:21,296
Endi, ikkinchi qavatdagi kiyinish xonasiga boring.

746
00:37:21,319 --> 00:37:25,289
Sumka va kiyimlarni saqlab qoʻyish mumkinmi?

747
00:37:25,312 --> 00:37:29,999
Ha, katta yuklaringizni biz saqlab qoʻyamiz.

748
00:37:30,022 --> 00:37:31,598
Katta rahmat.

749
00:37:31,622 --> 00:37:33,822
Qiyin emasmi?

750
00:37:33,845 --> 00:37:36,579
Aynan mos keldi.

751
00:37:36,602 --> 00:37:38,802
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

752
00:37:38,825 --> 00:37:41,760
Sizga juda mos tushdi!

753
00:37:41,783 --> 00:37:45,158
Vaa, juda xursand boʻldim!

754
00:37:45,182 --> 00:37:49,582
Kechqurun soat beshgacha doʻkonga qayting.

755
00:37:49,605 --> 00:37:51,855
Beshda, shundaymi?

756
00:37:51,878 --> 00:37:53,934
Tushunarli.

757
00:37:53,958 --> 00:37:58,011
Shaharda sayr qilishdan zavqlaning!

758
00:37:58,034 --> 00:37:59,680
Borib kelaman.

759
00:37:59,703 --> 00:38:01,203
16-Sahna: Sanʼat muzeyiga chiptalar sotib olish / Chipta sotib olish va sanʼat muzeyiga kirish

760
00:38:01,203 --> 00:38:03,237
Xush kelibsiz!

761
00:38:03,260 --> 00:38:05,677
Chipta kassasi shu yerda.

762
00:38:05,700 --> 00:38:09,067
Kattalar uchun ikkita chipta bering.

763
00:38:09,089 --> 00:38:11,760
Bugungi kun uchun chiptami?

764
00:38:11,784 --> 00:38:15,479
Ha, hozir kirish mumkinmi?

765
00:38:15,503 --> 00:38:19,315
Ha, darhol kirishingiz mumkin.

766
00:38:19,338 --> 00:38:22,180
Bugungi chipta narxi qancha?

767
00:38:22,203 --> 00:38:27,770
Bir kishiga 2000 soʻm, jami 4000 soʻm.

768
00:38:27,793 --> 00:38:31,193
Mana, 4000 soʻm.

769
00:38:31,216 --> 00:38:32,849
Katta rahmat.

770
00:38:32,872 --> 00:38:35,939
Chipta va bukletlaringiz.

771
00:38:35,962 --> 00:38:40,128
Muzey ichida suratga olish mumkinmi?

772
00:38:40,151 --> 00:38:45,318
Asosan suratga olish mumkin, lekin flesh ishlatish taqiqlanadi.

773
00:38:45,341 --> 00:38:48,546
Flesh ishlatmasam, muammo yoʻqmi?

774
00:38:48,569 --> 00:38:52,736
Ha, video suratga olishni iltimos qilmasangiz.

775
00:38:52,759 --> 00:38:54,638
Tushunarli.

776
00:38:54,661 --> 00:38:56,956
Faqat suratga olish bilan cheklanaman.

777
00:38:56,980 --> 00:39:01,613
Katta ryukzaklarni lokerga qoʻying.

778
00:39:01,636 --> 00:39:05,203
Tanga lokerlar qayerda?

779
00:39:05,226 --> 00:39:08,792
Kirish joyidan chap tomonda joylashgan.

780
00:39:08,815 --> 00:39:12,149
100 soʻmlik tanga qaytarib beriladi mi?

781
00:39:12,172 --> 00:39:16,857
Ha, bu 100 yen qaytariladigan turdagi chiptadir.

782
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:18,213
Yaxshi boʻldi.

783
00:39:18,236 --> 00:39:22,770
Bir marta tashqariga chiqsam, qayta kirish mumkinmi?

784
00:39:22,793 --> 00:39:26,999
Chiqishda stampingizni bosib olsangiz, qayta kirishingiz mumkin.

785
00:39:27,022 --> 00:39:30,956
Tushlikni tashqarida yeyishni xohlardim, yordam berasiz.

786
00:39:30,979 --> 00:39:35,012
Chiqayotganda xodimlarga xabar bering.

787
00:39:35,035 --> 00:39:36,890
Tushunarli.

788
00:39:36,914 --> 00:39:40,480
Koʻrish uchun qancha vaqt ketadi?

789
00:39:40,503 --> 00:39:45,437
Hammasini koʻrish uchun taxminan bir yarim soat kerak boʻladi.

790
00:39:45,461 --> 00:39:48,061
Sekin-asta koʻrib chiqaman.

791
00:39:48,084 --> 00:39:53,684
Ichkarida maxsus koʻrgazma ham oʻtkazilmoqda.

792
00:39:53,707 --> 00:39:55,961
U yerga ham borib koʻraman.

793
00:39:55,985 --> 00:39:57,485
17-Sahna: Bosh ogʻrigʻi dori maslahati / Bosh ogʻrigʻi uchun maslahat

794
00:39:57,485 --> 00:40:02,085
Salom, bugun nima uchun keldingiz?

795
00:40:02,108 --> 00:40:03,845
Boshim ogʻriyapti.

796
00:40:03,868 --> 00:40:06,719
Qachondan beri ogʻriyapti?

797
00:40:06,743 --> 00:40:10,143
Bugun ertalabdan beri ogʻriyapti.

798
00:40:10,165 --> 00:40:12,899
Isitmangiz bormi?

799
00:40:12,923 --> 00:40:15,566
Isitma yoʻq.

800
00:40:15,590 --> 00:40:18,644
Shamollash uchun dori ichayapsizmi?

801
00:40:18,668 --> 00:40:22,474
Ogʻriqni toʻxtatadigan dori qidirayapsizmi?

802
00:40:22,498 --> 00:40:26,098
Ha, bosh ogʻrigʻi uchun dori kerak.

803
00:40:26,121 --> 00:40:29,887
Odatda qanday dori ichasiz?

804
00:40:29,910 --> 00:40:33,444
Yoʻq, ayniqsa yoʻq.

805
00:40:33,467 --> 00:40:36,473
Dorilarga allergiyangiz bormi?

806
00:40:36,496 --> 00:40:39,463
Allergiya yoʻq.

807
00:40:39,486 --> 00:40:43,739
Bu isitma va ogʻriq qoldiruvchi dorini tavsiya qilaman.

808
00:40:43,763 --> 00:40:46,496
Qanday qabul qilish kerak?

809
00:40:46,519 --> 00:40:50,886
Kuniga uch marta, ovqatdan keyin iching.

810
00:40:50,909 --> 00:40:54,042
Ovqatdan keyin ichmasam boʻlmaydimi?

811
00:40:54,065 --> 00:40:59,532
Meʼdani asrab qolish uchun iloji boʻlsa ovqatdan keyin iching.

812
00:40:59,555 --> 00:41:01,555
Tushunarli.

813
00:41:01,577 --> 00:41:04,145
Bir marta necha tabletka ichish kerak?

814
00:41:04,168 --> 00:41:08,002
Bir marta 2 tabletka iching.

815
00:41:08,026 --> 00:41:11,882
Ichish oraligʻi qancha boʻlishi kerak?

816
00:41:11,906 --> 00:41:15,639
Kamida 4 soat oralatib iching.

817
00:41:15,662 --> 00:41:19,513
Qorin ogʻrigʻi uchun ham dori bormi?

818
00:41:19,537 --> 00:41:23,513
Meʼda dori ham xarid qilasizmi?

819
00:41:23,536 --> 00:41:27,550
Ha, koʻp yeb qoʻygandim, meʼdam ham ogʻriyapti.

820
00:41:27,574 --> 00:41:32,614
Shunda bu meʼda dorisini ham berib qoʻyaman.

821
00:41:32,637 --> 00:41:35,448
Bu dorida uyqu keltiradigan modda bormi?

822
00:41:35,471 --> 00:41:40,117
Bu bosh ogʻrigʻi dori biroz uyqu keltirishi mumkin.

823
00:41:40,141 --> 00:41:44,786
Bugun mashina haydashim kerak emas, muammo yoʻq.

824
00:41:44,809 --> 00:41:47,102
Unda yaxshi.

825
00:41:47,125 --> 00:41:49,792
Tezroq sogʻayib keting!

826
00:41:49,815 --> 00:41:52,148
Katta rahmat.

827
00:41:52,171 --> 00:41:53,671
18-Sahna: Koʻcha doʻkonida takoyaki buyurtma qilish / Koʻcha doʻkonida takoyaki buyurtma qilish

828
00:41:53,671 --> 00:41:56,162
Xush kelibsiz!

829
00:41:56,186 --> 00:41:58,719
Qanday mazali hid ekan!

830
00:41:58,742 --> 00:42:01,109
Bu qanday doʻkon?

831
00:42:01,132 --> 00:42:05,498
Takoyaki va okonomiyaki doʻkoni.

832
00:42:05,521 --> 00:42:08,210
Takoyakidan bir porsiya bering.

833
00:42:08,234 --> 00:42:12,634
Xop, takoyaki bir quti.

834
00:42:12,657 --> 00:42:15,700
Lazzatini tanlash mumkinmi?

835
00:42:15,724 --> 00:42:20,257
Sous, soya sousi va ponzu bor.

836
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:23,247
Eng qaysi biri eng mashhuri?

837
00:42:23,270 --> 00:42:28,003
Albatta, klassik sousli eng mashhuri.

838
00:42:28,026 --> 00:42:31,307
Unda, sousli qilib bering.

839
00:42:31,331 --> 00:42:35,380
Mayonez va koʻk nori sepilsa ham boʻladi.

840
00:42:35,404 --> 00:42:39,137
Ha, koʻp sepib qoʻying.

841
00:42:39,160 --> 00:42:43,167
Katsuobushi ham raqsga tushgandek qilib sepib qoʻyaman.

842
00:42:43,191 --> 00:42:44,767
Katta rahmat.

843
00:42:44,791 --> 00:42:47,400
Shu yerda yeb boʻladimi?

844
00:42:47,423 --> 00:42:52,757
Doʻkon yonida skameyka bor, u yerda yesa boʻladi.

845
00:42:52,780 --> 00:42:55,852
Yangidan qovurilgani issiqdek koʻrinadi.

846
00:42:55,875 --> 00:43:00,809
Ichki qismi juda issiq, kuyib ketmaslikka eʼtibor bering.

847
00:43:00,832 --> 00:43:04,681
Ha, ehtiyot boʻlip yeyman.

848
00:43:04,704 --> 00:43:07,937
Hisobingiz 600 yen.

849
00:43:07,960 --> 00:43:11,233
Kredit karta ishlatish mumkinmi?

850
00:43:11,257 --> 00:43:16,149
Kechirasiz, biz faqat naqd pul qabul qilamiz.

851
00:43:16,172 --> 00:43:18,179
Tushunarli.

852
00:43:18,203 --> 00:43:20,823
Naqd pul bilan to‘layman.

853
00:43:20,846 --> 00:43:23,916
Aynan shuncha miqdorni olamiz.

854
00:43:23,939 --> 00:43:27,106
Ichimlik ham sotasizlarmi?

855
00:43:27,129 --> 00:43:31,295
Sovuq limonada va bankali pivo bor.

856
00:43:31,318 --> 00:43:34,594
Limonadadan bitta qoʻshib qoʻying.

857
00:43:34,618 --> 00:43:40,251
Ha, 200 yen qoʻshimcha, jami 800 yen.

858
00:43:40,274 --> 00:43:43,571
Shishani qanday ochishni bilmayapman.

859
00:43:43,595 --> 00:43:47,361
Yuqori qismidagi sharchani kuchli bosib oching.

860
00:43:47,384 --> 00:43:50,041
Ochib beraymi?

861
00:43:50,065 --> 00:43:51,798
Iltimos.

862
00:43:51,821 --> 00:43:55,040
Qara, ochildi-ku!

863
00:43:55,064 --> 00:43:57,744
Mazali yeb qoʻying!

864
00:43:57,767 --> 00:44:00,252
Mehribonligingiz uchun rahmat.

865
00:44:00,276 --> 00:44:01,776
19-Sahna: Xalqaro pochtani yuborish / Xalqaro pochtani yuborish tartibi

866
00:44:01,776 --> 00:44:03,976
Xush kelibsiz!

867
00:44:03,999 --> 00:44:06,855
Iltimos, pochta oynasiga boring.

868
00:44:06,878 --> 00:44:10,919
Buni chet elga yubormoqchiman.

869
00:44:10,943 --> 00:44:14,343
Ha, xalqaro pochta ekan.

870
00:44:14,366 --> 00:44:17,701
Qaysi davlatga yubormoqchisiz?

871
00:44:17,724 --> 00:44:21,058
Amerikaga yubormoqchiman.

872
00:44:21,081 --> 00:44:24,056
Ichida nima bor?

873
00:44:24,079 --> 00:44:28,133
Sovgʻa qilingan shirinliklar va kiyimlar bor.

874
00:44:28,157 --> 00:44:32,095
Xavfli narsalar yoki suyuqliklar bormi?

875
00:44:32,118 --> 00:44:34,518
Yoʻq.

876
00:44:34,541 --> 00:44:37,874
Yukning ogʻirligini oʻlchaymiz.

877
00:44:37,897 --> 00:44:41,179
Iltimos, taroziga qoʻying.

878
00:44:41,203 --> 00:44:44,136
Ha, qoʻydim.

879
00:44:44,159 --> 00:44:46,733
Aynan 2 kilo ekan.

880
00:44:46,757 --> 00:44:48,991
Qachon yetib boradi?

881
00:44:49,014 --> 00:44:54,414
EMS bilan havo yoʻli orqali 5 kunda yetib boradi.

882
00:44:54,436 --> 00:44:58,203
Kema orqali yuborsam qancha vaqt ketadi?

883
00:44:58,226 --> 00:45:02,626
Kema orqali yuborsangiz, 2 oycha vaqt ketadi.

884
00:45:02,649 --> 00:45:07,082
Tez yetib bormasin, EMS bilan yuboraman.

885
00:45:07,105 --> 00:45:09,239
Ma'lum bo‘ldi.

886
00:45:09,262 --> 00:45:12,748
Onlayn tarzda yorliq yaratdingizmi?

887
00:45:12,772 --> 00:45:17,372
Yoʻq, hali yaratmadim.

888
00:45:17,395 --> 00:45:22,528
Smartfoningizda manzilni kiritib, yorliq yarating.

889
00:45:22,551 --> 00:45:25,618
Yozish namunasi qogʻozi bormi?

890
00:45:25,641 --> 00:45:30,255
Bu QR-kodni skaner qilib, manzilni kiriting.

891
00:45:30,278 --> 00:45:32,611
Bajarildi.

892
00:45:32,634 --> 00:45:34,903
Shtrix-kod chiqdi.

893
00:45:34,927 --> 00:45:36,606
Katta rahmat.

894
00:45:36,629 --> 00:45:39,696
Bu yerda chop etamiz.

895
00:45:39,719 --> 00:45:45,052
Chamadonni Yaponiya aeroportiga joʻnatish mumkinmi?

896
00:45:45,075 --> 00:45:50,842
Ha, aeroportga yetkazib berish xizmatidan ham foydalanishingiz mumkin.

897
00:45:50,865 --> 00:45:54,515
Kelish kunidan necha kun oldin joʻnatish kerak?

898
00:45:54,539 --> 00:45:59,539
Uchish kuningizdan 2 kun oldin bu yerga olib kelishingiz kerak.

899
00:45:59,562 --> 00:46:03,242
Yuklarsiz sayohat qilish juda qulay ekan.

900
00:46:03,265 --> 00:46:06,946
Keyingi safar albatta foydalaning.

901
00:46:06,969 --> 00:46:09,784
Bugungi joʻnatish narxi qancha?

902
00:46:09,808 --> 00:46:14,183
EMS bilan 4500 yen boʻladi.

903
00:46:14,207 --> 00:46:17,419
Elektron pul bilan toʻlayman.

904
00:46:17,442 --> 00:46:19,409
Pichoqni tegizib qoʻying.

905
00:46:19,432 --> 00:46:22,116
Rahmat.

906
00:46:22,139 --> 00:46:23,639
20-sahna: Matcha tajribasi darsi / Matcha bilan tanishuv

907
00:46:23,639 --> 00:46:25,472
Salom!

908
00:46:25,495 --> 00:46:28,978
Matcha tajribasiga xush kelibsiz!

909
00:46:29,002 --> 00:46:30,935
Salom!

910
00:46:30,958 --> 00:46:34,430
Bugun bu darsni intiqlik bilan kutgandim.

911
00:46:34,454 --> 00:46:36,743
Iltimos.

912
00:46:36,766 --> 00:46:40,903
Avval, bu shirinlikni tatib koʻring.

913
00:46:40,927 --> 00:46:44,127
Choydan oldin yeysammi?

914
00:46:44,150 --> 00:46:45,810
Ha.

915
00:46:45,833 --> 00:46:51,452
Shirinlikni oldin yeb qoʻysangiz, choy yanada mazaliroq boʻladi.

916
00:46:51,475 --> 00:46:53,208
Tushunarli.

917
00:46:53,231 --> 00:46:55,564
Yeyapman!

918
00:46:55,587 --> 00:47:00,058
Endi, choy tayyorlashga harakat qilaylik.

919
00:47:00,082 --> 00:47:02,582
Qanday qilib ichish kerak?

920
00:47:02,605 --> 00:47:06,742
Avval, chashkaga issiq suv quyamiz.

921
00:47:06,766 --> 00:47:10,847
Bu bambukdan yasalgan „chasen“ deb nomlangan asbob ekan.

922
00:47:10,871 --> 00:47:12,507
Ha.

923
00:47:12,530 --> 00:47:16,930
Bilakni tez-tez harakatlantirib aralashtiring.

924
00:47:16,953 --> 00:47:19,153
Bunday qilsammi?

925
00:47:19,176 --> 00:47:22,510
Köpik chiqmayapti.

926
00:47:22,533 --> 00:47:25,866
Yana bir bor urinib koʻring.

927
00:47:25,889 --> 00:47:30,730
Elbowsiz, bilakni silkitish kerak.

928
00:47:30,754 --> 00:47:35,230
A, yaxshi koʻpik chiqayapti!

929
00:47:35,254 --> 00:47:38,087
Juda yaxshi chiqardiz!

930
00:47:38,110 --> 00:47:41,154
Oyoqni buklab oʻtirish shart emasmi?

931
00:47:41,178 --> 00:47:46,711
Oyoq ogʻrisa, oyoqni choʻzib oʻtirishingiz mumkin.

932
00:47:46,734 --> 00:47:49,018
Juda yordam berdingiz.

933
00:47:49,041 --> 00:47:52,041
Oyoqlarim uyqudan ketdi.

934
00:47:52,064 --> 00:47:55,998
Stuldan ham foydalanishingiz mumkin.

935
00:47:56,021 --> 00:47:59,954
Ichishdan oldin chashkani aylantirish kerakmi?

936
00:47:59,977 --> 00:48:01,853
Ha.

937
00:48:01,877 --> 00:48:07,810
Old tomondan qochish uchun soat yoʻnalishi boʻyicha ikki marta aylantiring.

938
00:48:07,833 --> 00:48:11,833
Bu ham hurmat belgisi ekan.

939
00:48:11,856 --> 00:48:14,256
Aynan shunday.

940
00:48:14,279 --> 00:48:16,612
Buni yaxshi bilasiz-ku!

941
00:48:16,635 --> 00:48:21,693
Bir oz achchiq, lekin juda mazali.

942
00:48:21,716 --> 00:48:27,250
Oxirida „ssu“ deb tovush chiqarib ichib boʻling.

943
00:48:27,273 --> 00:48:30,750
Bu ichib boʻlinganlik belgisi ekan.

944
00:48:30,773 --> 00:48:32,387
Ha.

945
00:48:32,411 --> 00:48:35,944
Sizning tayyorlagan choyingiz juda ajoyib boʻldi.

946
00:48:35,967 --> 00:48:40,940
Yaponiya anʼanaviy madaniyatini tajriba qilishdan juda hayratlandim.

947
00:48:40,964 --> 00:48:44,402
Sizga yoqib tushganiga xursandman.